### 1. Get preferences
GET http://localhost:3003/notifications/preferences?userId=1

### 2. Update preferences (valid)
PUT http://localhost:3003/notifications/preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "email_enabled": true,
  "reminders_enabled": true
}

### 3. Update preferences (invalid: missing fields)
PUT http://localhost:3003/notifications/preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1
}

### 4. Create confirmation notification (valid)
POST http://localhost:3003/notifications/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "appointmentId": 10,
  "type": "confirmation",
  "email": "rana222400@bue.edu.eg"
}

### 5. Create notification (invalid type)
POST http://localhost:3003/notifications/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "appointmentId": 10,
  "type": "banana",
  "email": "rana222400@bue.edu.eg"
}


### 6. Schedule a reminder (valid)
POST http://localhost:3003/notifications/reminders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "appointmentId": 10,
  "email": "rana222400@bue.edu.eg",
  "appointmentTime": "2026-11-16T10:00:00Z"
}

### 7. Schedule a reminder (invalid time)
POST http://localhost:3003/notifications/reminders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "appointmentId": 10,
  "email": "rana222400@bue.edu.eg",
  "appointmentTime": "not-a-date"
}


### 8. Notification history
GET http://localhost:3003/notifications/history?userId=1

### 9. Notification history (missing userId)
GET http://localhost:3003/notifications/history

### 13. Login (to get token)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3001/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rana222400@bue.edu.eg",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 14. Get preferences (no token) -> 401
GET http://localhost:3003/notifications/preferences

### 15. Get preferences (valid token) -> 200
GET http://localhost:3003/notifications/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 16. Update preferences (valid token) -> 200
PUT http://localhost:3003/notifications/preferences
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "email_enabled": true,
  "reminders_enabled": false
}
### 17. Get preferences (tampered token) -> 401
GET http://localhost:3003/notifications/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}x

### 18. History (valid token) -> 200
GET http://localhost:3003/notifications/history
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}